  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>13.6</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>13.6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>36</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1.89</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><br />Photoelectron with <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub></math> is moving on a circular path.<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3200</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />The energy of photoelectron <math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>25</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>9.1</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>31</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>1.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>0.86</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><br />Now, using the Einstein equation<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>hν</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mn>1.89</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.86</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.03</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>",
